      },
      "body": "self.GPUEventAnalyser(list_kernels).compute_metrics()[\"busy_time\"] does a large amount of work that is not needed just to get busy time. \r\n\r\nBy creating a separate function to compute busy time, we avoid the unecessary work that compute_metrics calls: get_gpu_event_lists() and compute_metrics_dict().\r\n\r\n| Trace | Baseline (s) | Optimized (s) | Saved (s) | Speedup |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| trace1 | 0.49 | 0.48 | 0.01 | 1.02× |\r\n| trace2 | 58.5 | 57.5 | 1.0 | 1.02× |\r\n| trace3 | 80.2 | 69.8 | 10.4 | 1.15× |\r\n| trace4 | 87.5 | 88.7 | -1.2 | -1.01× |\r\n| trace5 | 100.0 | 98.3 | 1.7 | 1.02× |\r\n| trace6 | 119.6 | 109.0 | 10.6 | 1.10× |\r\n| trace7 | 152.2 | 148.4 | 3.8 | 1.03× |\r\n| trace8 | 207.9 | 199.5 | 8.4 | 1.04× |\r\n| trace9 | 231.4 | 226.1 | 5.3 | 1.02× |\r\n| trace10 | 264.8 | 262.9 | 1.9 | 1.01× |\r\n| trace11 | 1468.9 | 1444.7 | 24.2 | 1.02× |\r\n",
      "changedFiles": 2,
      "comments": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "ajassani"
            },
            "body": "this is a nice find, but makes the code a bit asymmetric, let me see if we can improve that",
            "createdAt": "2026-06-05T00:27:16Z",
            "databaseId": 4627103181,
            "updatedAt": "2026-06-05T00:27:16Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/AMD-AGI/TraceLens/pull/695#issuecomment-4627103181"
          },
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "kyle-hoffmeyer"
            },
            "body": "Tried to clean up the code. It may be worth having separate functions in `gpu_event_analyser.py` for calculating total communication time, exposed communication time, idle time, etc., in addition to busy time. \r\nCurrently users have to call self.GPUEventAnalyser.compute_metrics() which does a lot of extra work if the goal is just to get one metric (which is where the inefficiency was coming from).\r\nThis would be a separate PR. ",
            "createdAt": "2026-06-05T23:55:22Z",
            "databaseId": 4636487578,
            "updatedAt": "2026-06-05T23:55:44Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/AMD-AGI/TraceLens/pull/695#issuecomment-4636487578"
